"Artonan marriages are contracts with a great variety of terms."
"Ending a marriage is magically and legally possible but rarely socially acceptable."
"Only a contract flawless and indelible enough has marriage strength; lesser ones are relationship contracts."
"A badly made contract can erode, e.g. under hostility, and great authority can suppress one."
"Knights' spouses enter written marriage contracts; siblingholds keep them in manuscript libraries."
